/E (                                         -The educational simulation enables students to roleplay as diplomats, representing countries in debates on global issues. It promotes networking among participants from prestigious institutions and highlights youth-led initiatives. Skills in public speaking, research, negotiation, and international relations are developed as delegates draft resolutions from diverse perspectives. Through structured debate and consensus-building, participants learn about the UN, diplomacy, and various cultures, with conferences available for different age groups globally.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
